# Carlo Gavazzi EM26-96.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Carlo Gavazzi EM26-96 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: Carlo Gavazzi EM26-96 Communication Protocol v2r0 (2008)
# | - 3-phase 4-wire/3-wire power analyzer, panel-mount, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers FC03; input registers FC04 also accepted.
# | - INT32/UINT32: 2 registers LSW-first (word_order = "le").
# | - INT16/UINT16: 1 register (no word_order).
# | - Addresses are 0-based physical (direct protocol addresses).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=EM26-96
@vendor_website=gavazziautomation.com
@description=3-phase 4-wire panel analyzer — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/PF, averages, totals, demands, frequency, THD, import/export energy (INT32 LSW-first, INT16).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/carlo-gavazzi-em26-96.toml; Source: Carlo Gavazzi EM26-96 Communication Protocol v2r0 (2008). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

